  "election_date": "2026-11-03",
  "description": "The 2026 election for Missouri's 3rd Congressional District will determine who represents this east-central Missouri district \u2014 which includes parts of St. Charles County, Jefferson City, and surrounding areas \u2014 in the U.S. House of Representatives. First-term Republican incumbent Bob Onder, a physician and attorney elected in 2024, is seeking re-election in a district rated Solid Republican by the Cook Political Report (R+10). The Democratic primary features three contenders \u2014 Bethany Mann, Tommy Holstein, and Paul T. Wilson \u2014 while the Republican primary pits Onder against challenger John G. Fraser. Independent candidate Theodis Brown Sr. and Libertarian Jim Higgins are also on the ballot. The race takes place against the backdrop of ongoing legal challenges to Missouri's newly redrawn congressional map.",
